WEBVTT

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:11.920
Now, the only way to seal Z-ARC is—

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.590
Hope remains.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.830
Yuya's soul exists within Z-ARC now.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.670
The allies who fought against 
him have drawn it out.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.470
I know that Yuya exists within Z-ARC!

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:29.110
Reiji, pull Yuya out of that monster!

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:34.320
Z-ARC is currently using Pendulum.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:38.230
That alone is the proof that 
Yuya's soul still exists!

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.750
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.430
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:50.330
Their dragons call to each other,

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:53.590
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:32.000
The Soul's Pendulum

00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:35.970
Yuya, the one who created 
Pendulum Summon was you.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:38.940
Oh? Pendulum?

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:44.290
Ever since I decided to become a duelist, 
I was always the top runner...

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:48.820
Until the day that you invented 
the Pendulum Summon.

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:49.920
My turn!

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:58.300
Since then, I have studied you, analyzed you, 
and even created Pendulum Cards.

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:03.630
I set the Pendulum Scale with

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:09.130
Scale 2 D/D Savant Schrödinger 
and Scale 8 D/D Savant Dirac!

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:18.340
I can now summon monsters between 
Levels 3 and 7 simultaneously.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.610
Pendulum Summon!

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:24.280
Be born, my monsters!

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:28.590
Tuner Monster D/D Nighthowl!

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:31.400
Two D/D Savant Nikolas!

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:34.460
And D/D Vice Typhon!

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:40.030
All of them were born of your influence.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:43.290
You moved the hearts of so many people.

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:46.240
You should be able to fight 
against Z-ARC's evil heart!

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.190
That's right, Yuya...

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:51.710
You moved the hearts of City's people.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.770
Look, Yuya.

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:55.680
This is how I duel.

00:03:55.680 --> 00:04:00.730
I overlay the two D/D Savant Nikolas!

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:03.820
Xyz Summon.

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:09.690
Be born, D/D/D Wave High King Caesar!

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:19.780
Then, Level 3 Nighthowl tunes 
Level 7 D/D Vice Typhon!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.310
Synchro Summon.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:28.650
Be born, D/D/D Gust High King Alexander!

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:33.520
And I activate the effect of 
Vice Typhon in my graveyard.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:37.420
I banish this card and Nighthowl 
from my graveyard,

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:40.190
to Fusion Summon!

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:46.150
Be born, D/D/D Flame High King Genghis!

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:50.960
Reiji Akaba...

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:52.960
...is making his case to Yuya.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:55.770
Come back soon, Yuya!

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:01.210
I understand. Let's go together, Ray!

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:05.620
I can take you in.

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:08.390
I can serve as a vessel for you!

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:13.390
Pendulum to Xyz, Synchro, and Fusion...

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:17.130
You do seem a bit different 
than the others I've faced.

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:20.830
If my voice hasn't reached you yet,

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.100
I'll make it reach, with my duel!

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:26.590
I activate High King Alexander's effect!

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:31.780
When two or more D/D monsters are on my 
side of the field, its attack points double!

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:34.560
6000 attack points!

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.510
It can even beat that giant monster!

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:37.790
It can't.

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:42.250
Nothing can destroy that 
Supreme Dragon Z-ARC.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:46.720
And even if he does destroy the other 
monsters, that Pendulum Effect...

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:50.930
...will increase Z-ARC's life points by 
the damage he would have done!

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:53.400
That's why everyone's been suffering.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:57.340
I activate High King Genghis's effect.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:59.470
Until my next Standby Phase,

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:03.880
I can negate the effect of spell 
or trap cards on your field,

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:07.780
equal to the number of D/D monsters 
on my field other than Genghis.

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:12.350
I negate Supreme King Gate Zero 
and Supreme King Gate Infinity,

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:15.490
set in your Pendulum Zones!

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:17.690
Yeah! He did it!

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:20.940
Now, Z-ARC can't convert 
the damage into life.

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.960
So Reiji can attack, huh?

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:26.440
Even if he can't destroy Z-ARC, 
if he attacks the bad Odd-Eyes...

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:30.440
It can only negate its own 
destruction once per turn!

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:35.140
I activate Supreme King 
Dragon Odd-Eyes's effect!

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:38.010
I return it to my Extra Deck,

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:41.410
to Special Summon two Supreme 
King Dragon Darkwurms!

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:42.880
Oh, no!

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:46.830
I use one of High King Caesar's Overlay Units

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:48.140
to activate its effect!

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:52.660
Until my End Phase, I can negate

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:56.510
a Special Summon effect, 
and add to Caesar's attack points

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:59.750
those of the monster that was 
to be Special Summoned.

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:07.600
And I use the other Overlay Unit to add 
the same number of attack points

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:12.040
to High King Genghis, until my End Phase!

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:15.720
Wow! He thought Odd-Eyes got away...

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:18.020
But he sent the other monsters 
to the graveyard.

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:21.280
And increased his own 
monsters' attack points.

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:22.990
Two of them, too!

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:28.360
Battle! High King Genghis attacks 
Supreme King Z-ARC!

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:38.520
All right...

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:39.570
He cut down his life!

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:42.170
Even if he can't destroy it, 
he can still deal damage!

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:43.310
It'll work.

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:44.810
Get him, Reiji!

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:47.780
And open Yuya's heart!

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:51.520
High King Caesar attacks Supreme King Z-ARC!

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:02.990
Yes!

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:04.060
It's working...

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:05.960
Yeah! Keep it up!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:09.080
Go, go! Reiji! Counting on you, Reiji!

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.650
Get our feelings through...

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:12.170
...to Yuya!

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:17.380
High King Alexander attacks 
Supreme King Z-ARC!

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:19.880
Open your eyes, Yuya!

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.000
I now end my turn.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:44.430
In that instant, High King 
Caesar's effect ends,

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:47.460
and Caesar and Genghis's attack 
points return to normal.

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:01.760
Reiji Akaba,

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:04.360
you seem to have seriously misunderstood.

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:10.170
You seem to think that my duplicate, 
Yuya Sakaki, invented Pendulum.

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:11.600
It wasn't.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.300
It wasn't?

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:15.930
It was I who created Pendulum!

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:21.270
Supreme King Z-ARC was the 
true founder of Pendulum!

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:22.740
What?

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.640
Z-ARC is the founder of Pendulum?

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:28.610
But Yuya did Pendulum Summon first!

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:30.210
No...

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:31.670
You're wrong!

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:35.320
I created Pendulum for revenge.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:40.520
In that moment, my soul awakened...

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:47.170
with the determination that the 
next time I fought, I would win!

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:49.360
The next time you fought...

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.870
You mean...

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.440
Against Ray?

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.670
Tell me, Ray.

00:09:55.140 --> 00:10:00.010
How did you fight Z-ARC with 
the four cards Father made?

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.680
The four cards I created...

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:08.190
En Moon, from the unfathomable 
breath of the cosmos.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:12.420
En Winds, from the wind's drifting breath.

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:16.930
En Birds, from the 
invigorating breath of life.

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:21.430
En Flowers, from the breath of Mother Earth.

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:27.750
Using these four spell cards, Ray 
broke the Supreme King apart.

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:30.040
However...

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:39.330
Yes... That was when Pendulum was born.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:43.130
When I, once the ultimate being, 
was split into four,

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:46.420
that massive power began 
swinging between us...

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:54.110
I have to hurry.

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:55.400
My brother...

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:57.380
Lord Layra.

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:01.240
Tsukikage?

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:05.880
It was the power of Pendulum
 that brought me back to life!

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:10.290
Now, you'll be punished for 
the damage you've dealt.

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:13.750
I activate my trap Supreme Rage.

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:18.990
During the End Phase of a turn in which 
I take 2000 or more damage,

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:24.300
I can Special Summon my vassals 
from my graveyard or Extra Deck.

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:30.940
Appear, Supreme King Dragon Odd-Eyes!

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:34.600
Supreme King Dragon Clear Wing!

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:38.460
Supreme King Dragon Dark Rebellion!

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:42.750
Supreme King Dragon Starving Venom!

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:50.200
My turn!

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:03.000
Battle.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:08.170
Supreme King Dragon Clear Wing 
attacks High King Alexander!

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:11.910
A 2500-attack-point monster attacking 
a 6000-attack-point one?!

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:14.380
Clear Wing's effect activates.

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:18.400
It negates battle, destroys the 
monster it was attacking,

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:22.620
and deals that monster's attack 
points as damage to you!

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:27.020
D/D Savant Dirac's Pendulum Effect.

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:29.960
I Special Summon this 
card in defense position

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:32.430
and negate the effect damage I take.

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.130
That's Reiji for you...

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:39.470
Then, Supreme King Dragon Dark Rebellion 
attacks High King Caesar!

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:42.070
Will it destroy Caesar with its effect?

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:45.660
I use one of Dark Rebellion's Overlay Units

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:50.500
to decrease your monster's attack 
points to 0, until the End Phase,

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:53.990
and increase Dark Rebellion's 
by the same amount!

00:12:53.990 --> 00:12:54.920
Oh, no!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:57.160
Go, Dark Rebellion!

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:03.630
D/D Savant Schrödinger's Pendulum Effect...

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:06.810
I Special Summon this 
card in defense position

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:09.300
and negate the battle damage I take!

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:11.040
Stop fighting!

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:14.140
I activate Supreme King Dragon 
Starving Venom's effect!

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:19.660
Until the End Phase, it acquires the effect of 
High King Alexander in your graveyard!

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:21.050
What?

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:28.430
When two or more D/D monsters are on the field, 
High King Alexander's attack points are doubled.

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:30.520
5600 attack points?!

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.380
Reiji!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:36.030
Go, Starving Venom!

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:39.500
Bury High King Genghis!

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:47.570
I activate D/D Savant Schrödinger's effect!

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:52.510
Once, on each of our turns, I negate 
battle damage to a player!

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:58.730
He has two defense-position monsters left.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:02.650
Even if he takes the attack, 
he won't take damage.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:03.880
That's what you think...

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:08.730
Supreme King Dragon Odd-Eyes 
attacks D/D Savant Dirac!

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:13.130
In that instant, Starving Venom's 
effect activates.

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:16.700
Its effect gives a piercing effect 
to one of my monsters.

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:20.440
And because of Odd-Eyes's effect, 
damage is doubled!

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:23.170
Reiji...

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:30.210
It isn't him, right? 
Yuya would never do this!

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:34.690
It can't be true... 
That monster can't be Yuya!

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:37.150
Does that mean this world...

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:39.620
...is going to be destroyed?

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:42.760
I'll finish you off, with my own hands.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:47.270
I attack D/D Savant Schrödinger!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:54.770
Brother!

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:54.770
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:06.460
Tsukikage!

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:08.190
He's returned to life, too?

00:15:08.870 --> 00:15:09.920
That's...

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:12.160
Layra!

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:14.390
Layra! What are you doing?!

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:15.830
Layra!

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:20.100
I... I am not Layra.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.000
I am Ray!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:26.970
Ray?

00:15:26.970 --> 00:15:27.710
What?

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:29.240
Ray...

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:33.260
If you've been revived, 
then I'll be revived, too.

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:35.650
Whenever you try to destroy the world,

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:37.650
I'll always be here to stop it!

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:40.210
My turn!

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:45.060
I activate my spell card Life Transformation!

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:47.290
I send my whole hand

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:52.730
to the graveyard, to return En Flowers, 
En Birds, En Winds, and En Moon

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:54.500
from the graveyard and set them.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:57.160
The activation requirements have been met.

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:58.200
This means...

00:15:58.200 --> 00:15:59.700
You brat!

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:02.920
I activate Continuous Spell En Flowers!

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:13.720
It gives me shivers!

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:19.190
When three or more Xyz Monsters are in the
 graveyard and En Flowers is activated,

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:22.890
I can activate Continuous Spell En Birds.

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:28.700
Xyz Monsters, on either of our 
fields, in the graveyard, or banished,

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:33.100
become Normal Monsters, with 
their monster effects negated.

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:35.180
She turned Xyz Monsters...

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:36.810
...into Normal Monsters.

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:42.010
When three or more Synchro Monsters are 
in the graveyard and En Birds is activated,

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:45.220
I can activate Continuous Spell En Winds!

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:48.700
All Synchro Monsters become Normal Monsters,

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.190
with their effects negated.

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:57.090
The Supreme King Dragons that tormented us...

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:59.300
...are being depowered.

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:03.030
When three or more Fusion 
Monsters are in the graveyard

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:05.770
and En Birds and En Winds are activated,

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:08.700
I can activate Continuous Spell En Moon!

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:12.520
All Fusion Monsters become Normal Monsters,

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:14.150
with their effects negated!

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:22.890
Now, the Supreme King has lost his 
Synchro, Xyz, and Fusion properties!

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:24.860
Damn you!

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:26.960
Now you're finished!

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:29.930
The effect of En Flowers

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:34.010
negates the effect of all monsters 
on the field, destroying them.

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:37.080
And for each monster sent to the graveyard,

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:40.670
I deal 600 damage to its controller.

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:42.410
This should do it.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:44.070
Beautiful.

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:02.040
Damn you!

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.600
Yuya!

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:16.570
I am... not Yuya!

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:18.170
Yes, you are.

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:20.910
And right now, you are also Z-ARC.

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:24.120
Your heart has always been swinging.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.380
Yes, just like a pendulum!

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:28.340
Pendulum...

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:32.350
The four cards my father invented

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:37.330
are cards that return all power to nature, 
restoring innocence to everything.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:39.930
That's how Pendulum could be created!

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:43.630
A fully evil being couldn't 
start the Pendulum swinging.

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:45.870
He must still be within you,

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:49.610
Yuya Sakaki, with the innocent 
desire to bring smiles!

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:50.870
No!

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:52.650
I created it of my own will—

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:54.010
I believe in you, Yuya!

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:57.980
Yuzu!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.640
You aren't a devil...

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:04.690
You're the person who tried to bring 
smiles and happiness to the world!

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:06.080
Shut up!

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.950
What I bring is fear!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:10.460
Stop it... What are you saying?

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:14.940
What I want is to bring true fear to those

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:20.240
who forced me to fight and 
treated me like a spectacle!

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:22.570
No... That isn't true!

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:24.650
Smiles mean noth—

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:26.740
You came here to save me!

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:30.210
No matter how we were separated, 
you came after me!

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:33.670
I grew strong because of you!

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:35.920
I never forgot my smile...

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:39.320
Respond to me, Yuya! In front of everyone!

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:42.530
And come home with me. To our home.

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:48.340
Now, it's the last turn, Yuya!

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:56.870
If you get scared and cringe, 
you can't do anything.

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.410
If you want to win, then have courage...

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:02.640
...and step forward!

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:07.240
My... turn!

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:13.800
I activate Quick-Play Spell Smile Universe!

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:17.180
I Special Summon as many monsters as I can

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:20.740
from my Extra Deck, with effects negated!

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.890
The Supreme King Dragons are back.

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:47.630
Can it be... He isn't Yuya?

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:51.500
Pendulum Monsters are invincible.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.410
No matter how many times they're 
destroyed, they'll come back to life.

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:55.310
I won't let you!

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:58.600
I'll put an end to what I started!

00:20:58.600 --> 00:21:01.520
Damn you... You're just my duplicate.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:05.720
Monsters Special Summoned via this 
effect become Normal Monsters,

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:09.350
and give life to their opponent, 
equal to their attack points!

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:14.410
Wh-What are you doing? Stop it!

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:16.080
I've made up my mind.

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:17.990
I won't be a devil anymore!

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:21.030
Now! Do it, Layra!

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:25.200
The effect of En Flowers

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:29.520
negates the effect of all monsters 
on the field and destroys them.

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:32.730
And for each monster that's 
sent to the graveyard,

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:36.820
I deal 600 damage to their controller!

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:39.020
Damn you...

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.680
I... will...

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:49.890
The world is trying to split into four again!

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:53.950
Z-ARC wants to separate the 
dimensions and repeat it all—

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:55.290
I won't let it happen again!

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:57.320
I'll seal Z-ARC myself!

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:10.070
Layra?

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:13.900
Layra!

00:23:48.870 --> 00:23:51.200
Yuya, so you also got one, eh?

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:53.510
An invitation to the Junior 
Youth Championship.

00:23:53.510 --> 00:23:56.320
Well, well. I see you're both together...

00:23:56.320 --> 00:23:57.350
Sawatari?

00:23:57.350 --> 00:23:59.630
Don't tell me you got an invitation, too!

00:23:59.630 --> 00:24:01.320
What do you mean by that?!

00:24:01.320 --> 00:24:04.060
My father is expected to be the next mayor,

00:24:04.060 --> 00:24:08.120
and I get fantastic grades at LDS!

00:24:08.120 --> 00:24:09.260
It's only natural.

00:24:10.210 --> 00:24:14.430
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Junior Youth Championship.

00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:16.710
The fun is only getting started!
